{"id":"fc6f6230ad54a0dc","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-tarski.md","title":"Abstract Tarski Theorem T","display":"thm-abstract-tarski — Abstract Tarski Theorem T","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-tarski","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-tarski"],"display":"thm-abstract-tarski — Abstract Tarski Theorem T","source":"第 I 章 p. 9，Theorem T（PDF 26）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]","[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-tarski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-tarski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-tarski — Abstract Tarski Theorem T"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章 p. 9，Theorem T（PDF 26）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ae549c14f89182f\" href=\"?note=2ae549c14f89182f\" title=\"92-lem-abstract-diagonal\">92-lem-abstract-diagonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" href=\"?note=8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" title=\"92-df-abstract-expressibility\">92-df-abstract-expressibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73782856c9b2f46a\" href=\"?note=73782856c9b2f46a\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-pullback\">92-df-diagonal-pullback</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是抽象可表达性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G1},\\mathrm{G2}\">\\(\\mathrm{G1},\\mathrm{G2}\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73782856c9b2f46a\" href=\"?note=73782856c9b2f46a\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-pullback\">92-df-diagonal-pullback</a>的封闭条件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[T]\">\\(T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[T]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}tarski}\\vdash\\quad\n&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((\\mathbb N\\setminus T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathbb N\\setminus T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{G2}(\\mathcal L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}tarski}\\vdash\\quad\n&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((\\mathbb N\\setminus T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathbb N\\setminus T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{G2}(\\mathcal L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若第一个集合可表达，则引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in T\\leftrightarrow g(X)\\notin g[T]\\leftrightarrow X\\notin T\">\\(X\\in T\\leftrightarrow g(X)\\notin g[T]\\leftrightarrow X\\notin T\\)</span>，不可能。余两式依次由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G1}\">\\(\\mathrm{G1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G2}\">\\(\\mathrm{G2}\\)</span> 推出。这一结果不需要正确性或一致性，也没有把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 本身要求为可计算集合。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章 p. 9，Theorem T（PDF 26）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-lem-abstract-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"2ae549c14f89182f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-expressibility","status":"resolved","id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonal-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"73782856c9b2f46a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonal-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"73782856c9b2f46a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}$ 是抽象可表达性质；$\\mathrm{G1},\\mathrm{G2}$ 是[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]的封闭条件；$T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[T]$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G1},\\mathrm{G2}","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[T]","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}tarski}\\vdash\\quad\n&\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((\\mathbb N\\setminus T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*}),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathbb N\\setminus T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{G1}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{G2}(\\mathcal L)\\Longrightarrow\n\\neg\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}(T_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in T\\leftrightarrow g(X)\\notin g[T]\\leftrightarrow X\\notin T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G2}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1587,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski]]利用正确性与可表达类的条件得到真而未判定句；[[92-thm-abstract-tarski]]说明真句码集的对角补集不可表达；[[92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness]]给出假而未判定的对偶版本。此层无需先构造 PA、递归函数或 HBL 谓词。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-tarski]]"}],"outgoing":["2ae549c14f89182f","8dcd8ee3e47cef44","73782856c9b2f46a"]}